Hi,

I updated the CVS version of vxpocket, vxp440 and mixart drivers to
use the hotplug firmware loading mechanism on 2.6 kernels.  You don't
have to call the fw loader program (vxloader and mixartloader)
explicitly since the firmware is loaded through hotplug
automagically.

The feature is enabled only when the kernel is configured with
CONFIG_FW_LOADER and these drivers are built as modules.  In other
conditions (also on 2.2/2.4 kernels), you still need to use vxloader
or mixartloader programs.

The alsa-tools and alsa-firmware trees are updated for this change,
too.  Don't forget to update and install them before you update these
drivers.


Takashi


